# External dataset provenance log

Create a copy named `SOURCES.md` when adding a downloaded dataset. Keep one
record per dataset version; do not rely on the folder name alone.

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| Dataset title | |
| Creator / workspace | |
| Project URL | |
| Dataset version | |
| Download date (YYYY-MM-DD) | |
| Export format | Ultralytics YOLO detection |
| Advertised license | |
| License / attribution URL | |
| Original class list | |
| Class mapped to `lab_coat` | |
| Number of train / val / test images | |
| Any filtering / remapping | `scripts/prepare_labcoat_dataset.py` |
| Duplicate audit | |
| Notes / known annotation limitations | |

Do not redistribute a dataset just because it is publicly downloadable. Check
the license and image-level terms, retain attribution, and document all
transformations.
